<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">
<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px"><font color="#374151" face="Roboto, sans-serif"><span style="white-space-collapse: preserve; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">Dear {{{Recipient.FirstName}}} ,</span></font></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#374151"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">I trust this email finds you well. We are thrilled to share that EverQuote is now an approved vendor for State Farm agents, and we're delighted to offer exclusive discounts and subsidies to enhance your lead generation efforts.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#374151"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">As a State Farm-approved vendor, EverQuote is uniquely positioned to support your success in the insurance industry. For those states not subsidized enjoy special discounted rates on EverQuote's premium lead generation services, designed to provide you with exceptional value for your investment. For those states with subsidies take advantage of the financial subsidies made available by State Farm.</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#374151"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">To take advantage of these exclusive discounts and subsidies, simply reach out to me at 781-375-1825 or book on my calendar </span></span></span></span></span></span></span><a href="https://calendar.app.google/1d6ax4AYAhSjGXGN6">https://calendar.app.google/1d6ax4AYAhSjGXGN6</a></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#374151"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Best regards,</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>

<p style="line-height:1.38; margin-top:20px; margin-bottom:20px"><span style="font-size:12pt; font-variant:normal; white-space:pre-wrap"><span style="font-family:Roboto,sans-serif"><span style="color:#374151"><span style="background-color:#ffffff"><span style="font-weight:400"><span style="font-style:normal"><span style="text-decoration:none">Jaylen Jones<br />
781-375-1825</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></p>
